cim:UnderexcLimIEEE2 a owl:Class;
                     rdfs:comment "Type UEL2 underexcitation limiter which has either a straight-line or multi- segment characteristic when plotted in terms of machine reactive power output vs. real power output. Reference: IEEE UEL2 421.5-2005, 10.2 (limit characteristic lookup table shown in Figure 10.4 (p 32))."@en;
