<https://cimbology.com/ontology/iec61970.ttl> dcterms:description "OWL 2 / RDF-compatible ontology for IEC 61970 generated from dotTC57 (IEC TC57 CIM100). Preserves canonical http://iec.ch/TC57/CIM100# term IRIs."@en;
